# What a site installs. `git archive` builds the dist tarball composer
# downloads, so everything is excluded and the plugin is added back: a new
# development file stays out of a release until it is named here.
*               export-ignore
/src            -export-ignore
/src/**         -export-ignore
/composer.json  -export-ignore
/LICENSE        -export-ignore
/README.md      -export-ignore
